+#### SVE2 Narrowing
+
+## SVE2 saturating extract narrow
+
+# Bits 23, 18-16 are zero, limited in the translator via esz < 3 & imm == 0.
+SQXTNB          01000101 .. 1 ..... 010 000 ..... .....  @rd_rn_tszimm_shl
+SQXTNT          01000101 .. 1 ..... 010 001 ..... .....  @rd_rn_tszimm_shl
